                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this Warlord would lose a wound, roll one D6; on a 6, that wound is not lost.In addition, at the start of your Movement phase, this Warlord regains 1 lost wound.</characteristic>
