                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Command phase, you can select one friendly SALAMANDERS CORE or SALAMANDERS CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of this Warlord. Until the end of your next Command phase, that unit has the Objective Secured ability (see the Warhammer 40,000 Core Book).</characteristic>
