                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">LIBRARIAN model only. A model with this Relic knows one psychic power from the Promethean discipline (pg 62) in addition to any other powers it knows. When a Psychic test is taken for a model with this Relic that is attempting to manifest a psychic power from the Promethean discipline, you can add 1 to the total.</characteristic>
